    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-ăpĕrĭo</span></b> ,
			īre, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to open wide</i>, <i>throw open</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exapertae repente delubri fores, et audita
					major humana vox,</span>”
