					5, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">implicatissimam nodositatem,</span>”
				<i>to undo</i>, <i>unloose</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Conf. 10</span></i>
			.</div>
